<Learn
  path="/learn/where-ai-helps-your-business/"
  lede="Start with the work, not the tools: map how each team really does its job, time the steps, and score each step on volume, repetition, rules, data and the cost of a mistake. Only the steps that score well become AI projects; the rest get simple automation, a process fix, or are left with your people."
